, `subtotal = 3,805.00`, `igst = 684.90` successfully rejected `774` and resolved to `4,489.90`.\n     - Verified with printed words text (*\"FOUR THOUSAND FOUR HUNDRED AND NINETY RUPEES ONLY\"*), which resolves to `4,490.00`.\n     - Invalid line items (`PAN`, bank account, city names) were filtered out.\n\n---\n\n### Accessing the App\n\nThe FastAPI backend and UI server are running at:\n- **Application URL:** [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)","thinking":"The server is running on port 3000, as verified by the task details. Now, cross-referencing this with all modified files is necessary to confirm that `file://` links are present and that all coding guidelines are adhered to. This validation aims to ensure proper file accessibility and adherence to specified formatting.\n\n\n"}
